<figure id="S6.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S6.T2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TABLE II</span>: </span><span id="S6.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Overall Performance Comparison of All Models.
All metrics are reported as percentages (%), except for Mean Reciprocal Rank (MRR).
The top three results are highlighted by color:
<span id="S6.T2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#B5E550;">1st</span>, <span id="S6.T2.4.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#4B8BBE;">2nd</span>, and <span id="S6.T2.4.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#ECECA2;">3rd</span>.
Model name abbreviations are as follows:
Ours (R): Ours (with retrieval),
Ours (F): Ours (Full KG),
RoboHop,
Q-72/32: Qwen 72B/32B,
GF/P: Gemini-Flash/Pro,
WMNav: WMNavigation.
</span></figcaption>
